er from arm64 unpacked and checksum-verified archive artifacts, passes Linux amd64 checksum-verified archive packaging smoke under emulation, and has a native Linux amd64 GitHub workflow/just recipe wired but unrun while native Linux amd64 proof, native macOS release-archive proof, and Windows host/VM proof remain pending; Stage 5 local macOS arm64 real GGUF release proof now passes; macOS managed-binary codesign repair is implemented for local install/test-instance dogfood with native release-archive proof still under the release E2E roadmap; crash-report, project-update, deterministic workspace E2E, search-model selection, and cross-platform-release-E2E/Windows-support proposals open"
