wiki/plans/test-instance-namespaced-binary.plan.md
  title: Some("Plan: Coexisting Test Instance via Build-Time Namespace")
  "Category": "Developer ergonomics, install/runtime isolation, dogfooding safety"
  "Date": "2026-06-21"
  "Document Class": "Plan"
  "Related": "- wiki/plans/project-and-skill-rename.plan.md (prior art: name plumbing)"
  "Scope": "Implement the build-time instance namespace per the accepted decision: one derivation API driven by a build-script-validated compile-time constant (`build.rs` reads `LLM_WIKI_INSTANCE` and re-emits `LLM_WIKI_COMPILED_INSTANCE`, read via `env!`), a `test`-only scope guard, an output-equality invariant pinned by golden install snapshots, a scoped source lint, a release-build guard, namespaced install/uninstall/doctor, and a snapshot-bracketed live-session proof under both Claude Code and Codex. This plan must not change production behavior, names, paths, or the single-binary distribution invariant."
  "Sources": "- wiki/decisions/test-instance-namespaced-binary.decision.md - wiki/proposals/test-instance-namespaced-binary.proposal.md"
  "Status": "Completed"
  "Status note": "Completed 2026-06-22. Build-time `test` scope guard, central instance derivation, suffixed paths/skills/manifest identity, the golden empty-namespace output-equality snapshot, the `build.rs` release-build guard, the scoped suffixed-identity source lint with a negative test, the doctor active-instance banner and shared-project-tree caveat, temp-home install/status/uninstall smoke, and the snapshot-bracketed live-session proof all pass. Phase 6 evidence is recorded in `wiki/evals/test-instance-live-session-proof.eval.md`; this update completes Phase 7 docs/bookkeeping."
