wiki/proposals/search-model-selection.proposal.md
  title: Some("Search Model Selection: Per-Project and Cross-Project Profiles")
  "Category": "Search UX, install profile, runtime state"
  "Date": "2026-05-11"
  "Document Class": "Proposal"
  "Related": "wiki/plans/semantic-hybrid-search.plan.md, wiki/proposals/search-query-interpretation.proposal.md, wiki/decisions/search-backend-selection.decision.md, wiki/references/llm-search-model-licensing.reference.md, wiki/specs/wiki-query-skill.spec.md"
  "Scope": "Let users pick the model/profile bundle used by `llm-wiki search` and the cross-project profile used by `llm-wiki search-all` without rerunning the whole install flow manually. Project choices live in project-local `.llm_wiki/search.toml`; cross-project and new-project defaults live in `~/.llm_wiki/search.toml`. Interactive `--choose-model` may record a pending choice and hand off to the install flow, but only install-owned code may accept licenses, download artifacts, verify hashes, and promote the choice to active."
  "Sources": "wiki/plans/semantic-hybrid-search.plan.md, wiki/proposals/search-query-interpretation.proposal.md, wiki/references/llm-search-model-licensing.reference.md, review conversation 2026-05-11 establishing pending project choices for uninstalled models"
  "Status": "Proposed"
wiki/proposals/search-query-interpretation.proposal.md
  title: Some("Semantic and Hybrid Search for Natural-Language Queries")
  "Category": "Search UX, semantic retrieval, qmd-rs adapter"
  "Date": "2026-05-11"
  "Document Class": "Proposal"
  "Related": "wiki/plans/semantic-hybrid-search.plan.md, wiki/specs/wiki-query-skill.spec.md, wiki/decisions/search-backend-selection.decision.md, wiki/references/qmd-rs-search-crate.reference.md, wiki/evals/search-backend-selection.eval.md, wiki/proposals/cli-observability.proposal.md"
  "Scope": "Move `llm-wiki search` beyond the current FTS-only path by adding semantic search, hybrid fusion, query expansion, and optional reranking for natural-language project questions. The immediate trigger is that `llm-wiki search 'what are the most cutting edge battery technologies'` returned zero results while a manually optimized keyword query worked."
  "Sources": "wiki/decisions/search-backend-selection.decision.md, wiki/references/qmd-rs-search-crate.reference.md, wiki/evals/search-backend-selection.eval.md, assets/skills/wiki-query/SKILL.md (lines 32-34), src/search/qmd_rs.rs (current `store.search_fts` path), dogfooding session 2026-05-11 on `/Users/nicolasmartino/Documents/car/electric`"
  "Status": "Accepted"
